aurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ac1AeYqs8Z4_e2X5M3if2A","review_id":"YWjp7YJCOovodOlMwIFiNg","date":"2018-01-08T19:57:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9508795738220215,"text_excerpt":"Came here as tourists on a weekday to try some New Orleans cuisine, in New Orleans! As we arrived, my friend and I were told the wait was about 15 minutes to be seated, and we waited in the entrance area, pondering what we would order so that we could maximize our tasting potential of New Orleans food. When it was time to get seated, we went upstairs and around many other tables to finally get seated. Holy crap! This place is HUGE. And they were pretty much filled to capacity! Not sure if they have two or even three floors, which are all super huge. Louisiana crab meat cakes - I just realized when I got this dish that I've actually never had crab cakes before, so I wasn't sure what to exp..."},{"business_id":"ac1AeYqs8Z4_e2X5M3if2A","review_id":"Z49Yt6SPC3j0bBKbeaypfw","date":"2017-07-12T15:27:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9497677087783813,"text_excerpt":"This place is awesome! There was some confusion as to whether or not our party of 8 could be seated, but I think the woman who was so confused has just come on the schedule and didn't know what she was talking about. Once the manager go a hold of us we were taken up stairs to a huge room with a few other parties. It's was mostly empty! Our server was Darrick, and you need him to be your server. He was probably the. Eat server we've had in NOLA. He was polite, very helpful, and was smart! I totally took his recommendation for dinner and had NO regrets. My husband and I ordered oysters in the half shell for an appetizer. This was my first time eating this and they were wonderful. My in-laws..."},{"business_id":"ac1AeYqs8Z4_e2X5M3if2A","review_id":"Ck-__2Q6T2_N8XVkfEJbng","date":"2018-01-08T23:45:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9486095905303955,"text_excerpt":"Came here for our last dinner in New Orleans. It is quite close to Bourbon St if that's your plan. There was a line but we did not have to wait that long, maybe 10 minutes. We ordered the Gumbo - this was full of seafood and was really good. We also ordered the crabcakes. This I would recommend because the crawfish sauce they glaze it with pairs with the crab very well. We also got fried and blackened Alligator - this tasted like chicken. Overall not a bad experience."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ac1AeYqs8Z4_e2X5M3if2A","photo_id":"Yc6U8vNx8-zo3RMKvBbujw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Yc6U8vNx8-zo3RMKvBbujw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.89997398853302},{"business_id":"ac1AeYqs8Z4_e2X5M3if2A","photo_id":"c0UR5pgmosFlf-rlXsBuwQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/c0UR5pgmosFlf-rlXsBuwQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8318796157836914},{"business_id":"ac1AeYqs8Z4_e2X5M3if2A","photo_id":"FXqvgSlXHYE9vEcXNqDVAg","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/FXqvgSlXHYE9vEcXNqDVAg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8127403259277344},{"business_id":"ac1AeYqs8Z4_e2X5M3if2A","photo_id":"br_Qg-1GTjvIZjNtmlpc2g","label":"